        "type": "data",
        "source": "$1   _____                      _   \n$1  / ____|                    | |  \n$1 | (___  _____ __   ___  _ __ | |_ \n$1  \\___ \\|_  / '_ \\ / _ \\| '_ \\| __|\n$1  ____) |/ /| |_) | (_) | | | | |_ \n$1 |_____//___| .__/ \\___/|_| |_|\\__|\n$1            | |                    \n$1            |_|                    \n$2           ____   _____ \n$2          / __ \\ / ____|\n$2         | |  | | (___  \n$2         | |  | |\\___ \\ \n$2         | |__| |____) |\n$2          \\____/|_____/ ",
